{"4052990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kali and Ko", "steam_appid": 4052990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kali &amp; Ko</strong> is a cooperative adventure game where players take on the roles of Kali and Ko, a pair of junior explorers on their first major assignment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine mission to map a newly discovered island and make contact with the crew of seasoned explorers sent to the island a before you, quickly escalates into the adventure of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After becoming stranded, the pair discovers the crew and the island itself are in danger due to a corrupting force that's causing havoc on the island. Kali and Ko must work together to save the crew, defeat the corruption and find a way off the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/f64b30e2234e5ba0b0cf45985f880c11.poster.avif?t=1785222048\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/f64b30e2234e5ba0b0cf45985f880c11.webm?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/f64b30e2234e5ba0b0cf45985f880c11.mp4?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Difficulty - Play with anyone, regardless of skill. A veteran gamer and a total novice can play together without frustration. The game scales enemy aggression and puzzle complexity for the players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an island from sun-soaked beaches to the mysterious Shadowy forest, discover the 4 temples and save the missing crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catalog the unique flora and fauna you find on your journey. The island is alive with curious creatures to discover, and as junior explorers you'll want to do a good job cataloging all that you find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer four massive temples featuring layered challenges involving stealth, rhythm, precision jumping, and environmental manipulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against corrupted Guardians and rescue the missing crew members</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/0d5bedf5a4d141d58f9cfe945b07926f.poster.avif?t=1785222048\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/0d5bedf5a4d141d58f9cfe945b07926f.webm?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/0d5bedf5a4d141d58f9cfe945b07926f.mp4?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kali &amp; Ko</strong>, you are a team. Our unique <strong>Item-Swapping Mechanic</strong> means only one player can hold a core tool at a time. You’ll need to toss items back and forth mid-puzzle and mid-combat to solve the island’s temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/2fe59815c339b14d1321f85c876f8898.poster.avif?t=1785222048\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/2fe59815c339b14d1321f85c876f8898.webm?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/2fe59815c339b14d1321f85c876f8898.mp4?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kali &amp; Ko</strong> is a cooperative adventure game where players take on the roles of Kali and Ko, a pair of junior explorers on their first major assignment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine mission to map a newly discovered island and make contact with the crew of seasoned explorers sent to the island a before you, quickly escalates into the adventure of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After becoming stranded, the pair discovers the crew and the island itself are in danger due to a corrupting force that's causing havoc on the island. Kali and Ko must work together to save the crew, defeat the corruption and find a way off the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/f64b30e2234e5ba0b0cf45985f880c11.poster.avif?t=1785222048\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/f64b30e2234e5ba0b0cf45985f880c11.webm?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/f64b30e2234e5ba0b0cf45985f880c11.mp4?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Difficulty - Play with anyone, regardless of skill. A veteran gamer and a total novice can play together without frustration. The game scales enemy aggression and puzzle complexity for the players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an island from sun-soaked beaches to the mysterious Shadowy forest, discover the 4 temples and save the missing crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catalog the unique flora and fauna you find on your journey. The island is alive with curious creatures to discover, and as junior explorers you'll want to do a good job cataloging all that you find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer four massive temples featuring layered challenges involving stealth, rhythm, precision jumping, and environmental manipulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against corrupted Guardians and rescue the missing crew members</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/0d5bedf5a4d141d58f9cfe945b07926f.poster.avif?t=1785222048\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/0d5bedf5a4d141d58f9cfe945b07926f.webm?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/0d5bedf5a4d141d58f9cfe945b07926f.mp4?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kali &amp; Ko</strong>, you are a team. Our unique <strong>Item-Swapping Mechanic</strong> means only one player can hold a core tool at a time. You’ll need to toss items back and forth mid-puzzle and mid-combat to solve the island’s temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/2fe59815c339b14d1321f85c876f8898.poster.avif?t=1785222048\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/2fe59815c339b14d1321f85c876f8898.webm?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/extras/2fe59815c339b14d1321f85c876f8898.mp4?t=1785222048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Kali &amp; Ko is a cooperative adventure game where players play a pair of junior explorers on their first major assignment. What begins as a routine mission quickly escalates into the adventure of a lifetime.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“It looks really nice dear.”<br />\r\nMy Mom<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/d190d97e3d8cc170cfdb95977acf50c1ded8b7ea/header.jpg?t=1785222048", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/a43bd7c760d60ace5fcbba8542d1b7984e769420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785222048", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052990/a43bd7c760d60ace5fcbba8542d1b7984e769420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785222048", "website": "https://www.niceaxegames.com/kaliko", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660 / RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wi